                "cleary": "The Master gave an evening talk to the group: 'Sometimes I take away the person but not the environment; sometimes I take away the environment but not the person; sometimes I take away both person and environment; sometimes I take away neither person nor environment.'",
                "ai_literal": "The Master at evening instructions showed the assembly, saying: 'In my transformative teaching, sometimes I take away the person but do not take away the context; sometimes I take away the context but do not take away the person; sometimes person and context are both taken away; sometimes neither person nor context is taken away.'"
